message: "If you use this material, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Arc Posture Review — read-only security assessment kit for Azure Arc-enabled servers"
abstract: >-
  Guided checklist, read-only PowerShell collector (Azure Resource Graph + Azure CLI) and
  in-browser analysis to assess the security posture of Azure Arc-enabled servers and SQL Server
  enabled by Azure Arc. Method based on the Cloud Adoption Framework Secure methodology and the
  Microsoft Cloud Security Benchmark, with decision trees, action plan, recommended alerts and
  reports in English and Brazilian Portuguese.
type: software
